/-
  Unicode.Generated.PropListData

  Materialized PropList binary-property range table (UCD 17.0.0), pinned
  as a `List` literal so per-codepoint lookups reduce in the kernel. The
  parser and `include_str` source live in `Unicode.Generated.PropList`,
  which imports this module and carries the build-time drift gate. The
  `BinaryProperty` type is defined here to avoid a circular import.
-/

namespace Unicode.Generated.PropList

set_option maxRecDepth 1000000

